Rationale: The claim states that the high security prison holding one of the two arrestees from the 18 September 2014 counter-terrorism raid opened in the year 2001. However, the evidence from HM Prison Maghaberry clearly states that it opened in 1986, not 2001. This directly contradicts the claim. Additionally, while the prison is identified as a high security facility, there is no reliable evidence confirming that it is the specific prison holding one of the arrestees from the 18 September 2014 counter-terrorism raid.
